1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,450
After thousands of years of penance...

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:05,228
why did Kumbhakarna ask for sleep as a boon?

3
00:00:05,228 --> 00:00:06,049
The truth is,

4
00:00:06,049 --> 00:00:08,070
he never asked for sleep at all.

5
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,788
His tongue didn't slip,

6
00:00:09,788 --> 00:00:11,186
it was made to slip.

7
00:00:11,186 --> 00:00:13,143
Sage Agastya tells Shri Ram,

8
00:00:13,143 --> 00:00:15,100
amidst five fires in summer,

9
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,011
under open skies in the rain,

10
00:00:17,011 --> 00:00:18,987
Kumbhakarna did intense penance.

11
00:00:18,987 --> 00:00:21,024
When Brahma came to grant a boon,

12
00:00:21,024 --> 00:00:22,630
the gods trembled in fear.

13
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,589
[Devata] Lord,

14
00:00:23,589 --> 00:00:25,483
he's devoured apsaras and sages.

15
00:00:25,483 --> 00:00:27,850
With a boon, he'll swallow three realms!

16
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:30,380
Then Lord Brahma invoked Goddess Saraswati and said,

17
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:34,770
[Brahma] "Sit upon this demon's tongue and speak only what the gods desire."

18
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,024
Kumbhakarna had no idea that on his tongue,

19
00:00:39,024 --> 00:00:40,400
someone else was seated.

20
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,500
[Brahma] "Ask your boon."

21
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,441
[Kumbhakarna] "God of gods,

22
00:00:43,441 --> 00:00:44,950
for years and years...

23
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,280
[Kumbhakarna] I wish to sleep."

24
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,333
Brahma said,

25
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:51,140
"So be it!" And Saraswati departed.

26
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,350
[Kumbhakarna] "What did I just say?

27
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,580
[Kumbhakarna] Surely the gods have tricked me!"

28
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:01,420
Boons come not just from penance,

29
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:04,766
but from your karma too. An ancient tale,

30
00:01:04,766 --> 00:01:07,669
an answer for today. This is Naad Katha.

31
00:01:07,669 --> 00:01:09,120
Follow or subscribe.

